{"coverage":[{"acId":"AC-1.1","testId":"AC_1_1_NotTestableAtAppBoundary","verdict":"weak","why":"The test uses one default sign-in identity and canned success/failure responses, so it does not assert requests for a valid Folio3 identity and each non-Folio3 identity or their response statuses."},{"acId":"AC-2.1","testId":"AC_2_1_NotTestableAtAppBoundary","verdict":"weak","why":"The test renders a mocked roster rather than retrieving the signed-in employee profile, and it does not assert the employee ID, identity match, or registered make, model, and color fields."},{"acId":"AC-2.2","testId":"AC_2_2_NotTestableAtAppBoundary","verdict":"weak","why":"The test returns a changed mocked roster but does not perform an administrator assignment update and then retrieve the employee profile to verify the updated fields."},{"acId":"AC-2.3","testId":"AC_2_3_NotTestableAtAppBoundary","verdict":"weak","why":"The test does not submit a corporate email that mismatches the signed-in identity or assert the non-success response status and absence of all employee and vehicle fields."},{"acId":"AC-2.4","testId":"AC_2_4_NotTestableAtAppBoundary","verdict":"weak","why":"The test never requests another employee's profile or vehicle data and only checks that two profile values are not rendered after a canned 403."},{"acId":"AC-2.5","testId":"AC_2_5_NotTestableAtAppBoundary","verdict":"weak","why":"The test renders a mocked roster record but does not establish administrator permissions, retrieve another employee's record, or assert a successful permission-limited response."},{"acId":"AC-3.1","testId":"AC_3_1_NotTestableAtAppBoundary","verdict":"weak","why":"The test verifies the UI blocks submission before any claim request, so it does not assert a rejected claim response whose field identifies vehicle registration as required."},{"acId":"AC-3.2","testId":"AC_3_2_NotTestableAtAppBoundary","verdict":"weak","why":"The test asserts the submitted vehicle fields and displayed plate but not that the returned vehicle record contains every field or that the registered plate is eligible for a claim."},{"acId":"AC-4.1","testId":"AC_4_1_NotTestableAtAppBoundary","verdict":"weak","why":"The test checks only one enabled weekday and the Saturday and Sunday disabled states, without asserting returned values for every weekday including a weekday holiday."},{"acId":"AC-5.1","testId":"AC_5_1_NotTestableAtAppBoundary","verdict":"weak","why":"The test checks a success message from a canned response but does not assert the response status and returned status value Released."},{"acId":"AC-5.3","testId":"AC_5_3_NotTestableAtAppBoundary","verdict":"weak","why":"The test checks an error message after a canned conflict but does not assert that the returned release status remains unchanged."},{"acId":"AC-5.4","testId":"AC_5_4_NotTestableAtAppBoundary","verdict":"weak","why":"The test makes only one request and returns a conflict for it, without testing the eligible holder's release, the non-holder's rejection, and rejection for an already-claimed space."},{"acId":"AC-6.1","testId":"AC_6_1_SubmitsSelectedDateAndShowsSuccessfulSchedule","verdict":"weak","why":"The test asserts the selected date was submitted and a generic success message appeared, but not that the response contains a saved release record for each selected date."},{"acId":"AC-6.2","testId":"AC_6_2_ShowsValidationWhenScheduleRequestIsRejected","verdict":"weak","why":"The test supplies a canned conflict for an out-of-window date, so it does not verify that the scheduling API itself rejects that date."},{"acId":"AC-7.1","testId":"AC_7_1_ConfirmsCancellationAfterSuccessfulCancellationResponse","verdict":"weak","why":"The test checks a cancellation confirmation but does not assert that the returned audit list contains both scheduling and cancellation events."},{"acId":"AC-7.2","testId":"AC_7_2_LeavesClaimedReleaseUnconfirmedWhenCancellationIsRejected","verdict":"weak","why":"The test checks that the date remains visible 