s that the UI does not continue after a canned 403, but does not establish that the requester has dedicated parking or verify the claim API's rejection behavior."},{"acId":"AC-12.1","testId":"AC_12_1_ShowsTheSelectedPlateAndAssignedFloor","verdict":"weak","why":"The test renders a mocked pass without submitting a claim and does not assert multiple vehicles, the selected plate as the only authorized plate, or the greatest-capacity floor and tie-break."},{"acId":"AC-12.3","testId":"AC_12_3_RequiresARegisteredVehicleBeforeClaiming","verdict":"weak","why":"The test checks a UI message with no vehicles but does not submit a claim and assert a rejected response whose field identifies vehicle selection as required."},{"acId":"AC-13.1","testId":"","verdict":"no-test","why":"The linked test only renders office report-recipient settings, so add a test that processes an availability notification and asserts eligible recipients and the fixed-template email payload."},{"acId":"AC-14.1","testId":"AC_14_1_LeavesAnActiveClaimAndDoesNotOfferCancellation","verdict":"weak","why":"The test disables the cancellation button and prevents any request, rather than submitting a cancellation and asserting a rejected response with the claim still active."},{"acId":"AC-15.1","testId":"AC_15_1_ShowsTheAuthorizedEntranceRecord","verdict":"weak","why":"The test renders a mocked activity row but does not process a detection or assert its date, time, authorized result, green-activation call, and authorized response."},{"acId":"AC-15.2","testId":"AC_15_2_ShowsAnUnauthorizedEntranceRecord","verdict":"weak","why":"The test renders a mocked denied row but does not process a detection or assert its date, time, unauthorized result, non-green indicator call, and unauthorized response."},{"acId":"AC-15.3","testId":"AC_15_3_DoesNotShowAnAuthorizationForAnEmptyDetectionResult","verdict":"weak","why":"The test renders an empty activity list rather than processing a pedestrian, motorcycle, or other non-car detection and asserting no authorization result or green-activation call."},{"acId":"AC-16.1","testId":"AC_16_1_ShowsPermanentStickerEntriesAsNotBlocked","verdict":"weak","why":"The test displays a mocked permanent-sticker row but does not process the detection in the released-and-reclaimed scenario or assert that no temporary decision or entry-blocking call occurs."},{"acId":"AC-16.3","testId":"AC_16_3_ExplainsThePermanentHolderCancellationSafeguard","verdict":"weak","why":"The test checks explanatory UI text but does not process a permanent-holder entry or assert a detection row and canceled temporary allocation row."},{"acId":"AC-16.4","testId":"AC_16_4_ShowsTheTemporaryClaimantAsDeniedAfterCancellation","verdict":"weak","why":"The test displays a mocked denied row but does not process the claimant's plate after cancellation or assert that no green-activation call is sent."},{"acId":"AC-17.1","testId":"AC_17_1_ShowsAClosedFailureWithNoManualVerificationPath","verdict":"weak","why":"The test renders one mocked unreadable-plate row and static guidance but does not exercise each stated failure, assert an unsuccessful response and recorded failure, or verify no green call."},{"acId":"AC-17.2","testId":"AC_17_2_ShowsAuthorizationAfterEntranceServiceRestoration","verdict":"weak","why":"The test renders a mocked authorized row but does not process a valid detection after restoration or assert the authorization response and green-activation call."},{"acId":"AC-18.1","testId":"AC_18_1_ShowsUnusedDedicatedParkingRecord","verdict":"weak","why":"The test renders a mocked report row but does not run utilization evaluation with an unreleased working-day space and no vehicle entry to assert row creation."},{"acId":"AC-18.2","testId":"AC_18_2_ShowsUnusedTemporaryParkingRecord","verdict":"weak","why":"The test renders a mocked report row but does not run utilization evaluation for a claimed vehicle with no entry detection to assert row creation."},{"acId":"AC-18.3","testId":"AC_18_3_ShowsPermanentStickerDetectionInActivityHistory","verdict":"weak","why":"The test adds a mocked activity event and displays it, but does not process the permanent-sticker detection or assert that its row is available to utilization evaluation."},{"acId":"AC-19.1","testId":"AC_19_1_ShowsWeeklyReportListsAndStatistics","verdict":"weak","why":"The test checks report data rendered from a mock rather than the Monday report job's generated file, and it does not assert the weekly statistics as part of that file."},{"acId":"AC-20.1","testId":"AC_20_1_ShowsConfiguredStakeholderRecipients","verdict":"weak","why":"The test displays saved recipient settings but does not run the report email job or assert that its outbound call contains the recipients and generated report."},{"acId":"AC-20.2","testId":"AC_20_2_ShowsUpdatedStakeholderRecipientsAfterSave","verdict":"weak","why":"The test displays a canned update response without establishing administrator authentication or reading back the recipient list for the next report."},{"acId":"AC-20.3","testId":"AC_20_3_KeepsRecipientsWhenUpdateIsForbidden","verdict":"weak","why":"The test does not establish an authenticated non-administrator, and its asserted 403 is assigned inside the mock rather than observed from the update API response."},{"acId":"AC-21.1","testId":"AC_21_1_ShowsUnusedParkingWithoutEnforcementActions","verdict":"weak","why":"The test only checks that no matching buttons render, not that evaluation and report jobs create no warning, suspension, or penalty rows, events, emails, or outbound calls."},{"acId":"AC-22.1","testId":"AC_22_1_ShowsRetainedParkingHistory","verdict":"weak","why":"The test displays a mocked history row but does not configure a retention policy, run the retention job across in-period and expired records, or assert retention and removal or archiving."}]}